      "changes": "Preserve supplied numerical bodies. All 720 contractions independently accounted for: 691 selected current BSE contractions, 21 explicit inherited cc-pVDZ d-polarization fallbacks in TZ/QZ/5Z, 8 GFN1 H STO/projection reconstructions. Correct inherited unverified CC-BY header claim; retain Dunning/ccRepo attribution. See tests/data/secondary-basis-provenance.json.",
